# reconcileSpawningSprites() takes the `findDaemonByMachineId(...) !== undefined` branch
# (lifecycle.ts:1010-1012) instead of the terminate branch proved in scenario 4.
#
# RESULT: not reachable by racing. Three attempts, then the code shows why.

